      "code": "if (info->n_missing_values > 3) {",
      "note": "The abs() at line 254 (step 6) is the failed normalization; line 258 is the missing obligation the patch supplies. Both the vulnerable and fixed builds still reach spss_varinfo_free(info) on the error path, but in the fixed build the record is rejected before any overflow, so info->label is still NULL and the free is skipped by the non-NULL check.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
